OL,5,G1500 The Colours in Sound, with
OL,6,G     Caroline Shaw
OL,7,     FCaroline Shaw explores how
OL,8,     Fcomposers use their paint brushes
OL,9,     Fto draw light to hidden qualities
OL,10,     Fwithin tones. With music from
OL,11,     FMonteverdi to Messiaen, Debussy to
OL,12,     FDuke Ellington.
